---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, url } from '../consts';
---

<Base title={`Support — ${SITE.name}`} description="Setup help and troubleshooting for CamLock.">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Help</p>
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.supportEmail}`}>{SITE.supportEmail}</a>. Include your phone
        model and Android version; it is usually enough to reproduce the problem.
      </p>

      <h2>Protection keeps stopping on its own</h2>
      <p>
        Some manufacturers kill background services aggressively. In CamLock's Settings, grant the
        battery exemption, and in Android Settings allow CamLock to run unrestricted. CamLock posts
        a tamper alert whenever protection dies without you stopping it, so you will know.
      </p>

      <h2>My child is not recognised</h2>
      <p>
        Add more face samples from a second angle and in different light: open the child, then
        "Add more face samples". If that does not help, move the sensitivity preset to lenient.
      </p>

      <h2>The phone locks for the wrong person</h2>
      <p>
        Siblings and parent-child resemblance are the known cause. Move the sensitivity preset to
        strict, and re-enrol the affected child with clear, well-lit samples.
      </p>

      <h2>It does not lock after a reboot</h2>
      <p>
        Android does not allow a camera service to start in the background. CamLock posts a
        notification after a reboot; tapping it starts protection again.
      </p>

      <h2>I cannot get into the app</h2>
      <p>
        CamLock requires a strong biometric, with no PIN fallback. If your fingerprint is not
        recognised, or none is enrolled, enrol one in Android Settings and reopen the app.
      </p>

      <h2>Delete everything</h2>
      <p>
        Settings has "Delete all data": children, face templates, the event log and your settings.
        Uninstalling removes the same data.
      </p>

      <p><a href={url('/privacy')}>Privacy policy</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 44rem; }
  .prose h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.05; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 2.25rem; }
  .prose p { color: var(--muted); }
  .prose .lede { font-size: 1.05rem; }
</style>
